	(property "Note" "Sourceable exact100nF50VX7R±10%0402 bypass; Samsung MassProduction, max1.05x0.55x0.55mm. Public typical DC/lowAC plus tolerance/temp/6%aging screen yields~46.6nF at13.2V and~63.6nF at3.3V; separate-factor screen is not guaranteed combinedCeff. Existing bulk bypass remains. Keep short direct local pad/return layout.  Private418 exact native denseassembly courtyard encloses conservative maximum body(1.1, 0.6)mm plus100umXY placement, and all actual pads plus50um edge margin. Physical same-net solder pads remain separately screened at>=100um gap; no electrical clearance rule is waived."
